WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Design for manufacture asks how a shape can be made, joined, inspected and repaired. Attractive geometry still needs a plausible process.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
A deep undercut may complicate a simple forming tool; mark the direction the tool or part must move.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Constraint audit

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A view can support interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance by itself.

